s":955,"watchers":13369,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytest-dev/pytest/pulls/2468","html_url":"https://github.com/pytest-dev/pytest/pull/2468","diff_url":"https://github.com/pytest-dev/pytest/pull/2468.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/pytest-dev/pytest/pull/2468.patch","merged_at":"2017-06-14T08:57:58Z"},"body":"It turns out pytest was triggering the `pytest_collectreport` hook when collecting the nodes in order to find the item specified in the command-line, but this is incorrect given that those nodes might not end up in the final list of items that will actually be run.\r\n\r\nAs a bonus this now only reports the exact number of items that will be executed:\r\n\r\n```python\r\nclass TestClass(object):\r\n    \r\n    def test_main(self):\r\n        assert 1\r\n        \r\n    def test_bla(self):\r\n        assert True\r\n\r\n```\r\n```\r\n$ pytest .tmp\\test_foo.py::TestClass::test_main\r\n============================= test session starts =============================\r\nplatform win32 -- Python 3.6.0, pytest-2.0.1, py-1.4.33, pluggy-0.4.0\r\nrootdir: C:\\pytest, inifile: tox.ini\r\nplugins: hypothesis-3.7.0\r\ncollected 1 item\r\n\r\n.tmp\\test_foo.py .\r\n\r\n========================== 1 passed in 0.01 seconds ===========================\r\n```\r\n\r\ncc @rev112\r\n\r\nFix #2464\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytest-dev/pytest/issues/2468/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytest-dev/pytest/issues/2468/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":1108983250,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDExMDg5ODMyNTA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytest-dev/pytest/issues/events/1108983250","actor":{"login":"nicoddemus","id":1085180,"node_